ked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-07-17T08:48:21Z","updated_at":"2025-07-23T18:39:15Z","closed_at":"2025-07-23T18:38:04Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- reproducible in 4.5-beta3\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot 4.5-beta3-mono\n\n### Issue description\n\nReparenting a node with embedded resources or paths via the Context Menu will cause error spam, in particular `MeshInstance3D`s and `SubviewPort`s and resources referencing `ViewportTexture`s, but probably many more. Sometimes, these errors cause the node or resource functionality to break.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bb16a3c2-5182-4965-8823-433e4e56f89b\n\nThis is also true for resources, especially those that cannot exist on disk, like ViewportTextures, and it seemingly applies to [Export]ed properties from `.cs` scripts (repro pending, this sub-case is a bit complex)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nReparent any node that has resources, like a `MeshInstance3D` with the default `BoxMesh`.\n \n1. open MRP project, repro.tscn\n2. right click the \"reparent me\" node and reparent it to a new node (any node type should work, including `Node` and `Node3D`.\n3. observe errors\n4. observe \"Skeleton\" field in inspector has invalid value now! \n\n<img width=\"640\" height=\"578\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1c20a6e9-e53b-4e8c-901c-d45b972f8252\" />\n\n5. unparent it again\n6. observe further errors\n7. add more nodes, change child order, etc.\n8. observe further errors\n9.  save and quit\n10. restart editor, observe (sometimes) more errors.\n11. unpack project from scratch\n12. create an empty node\n13. reparent the \"reparent me\" node by drag & drop (instead of context menu)\n14. observe no error\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP-reparenting.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21289683/MRP-reparenting.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com